%% Register request sequence. Grounded in the customer registration plan; git SHA: none (no commits yet).
%% Green bands are deterministic and set the status. The amber band is advisory and never changes it.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Registrant
  participant F as Registration form (Next.js)
  participant API as FastAPI register route
  participant R as Domain rules
  participant DNS as Public DNS
  participant AD as GeminiAdvisor (advisory only)
  participant V as Vertex AI Gemini
  participant S as RegistrationService
  participant BQ as BigQuery customer_ops

  U->>F: Submit the form
  F->>API: POST /api/v1/customers/register with Idempotency-Key

  rect rgb(213, 232, 212)
    Note over API,DNS: Deterministic checks. No model call.
    API->>API: Pydantic body check, per-client rate limit, bot check
    opt shape error, rate limit, or bot check failure
      API-->>F: 422 validation-error, 429 rate-limited, or 403 bot-check-failed
    end
    API->>R: Normalize email, phone, tax ID, and name
    API->>R: Email syntax and disposable-domain list
    opt invalid input or disposable domain
      API-->>F: 422 email-invalid, email-disposable, phone-invalid, or tax-id-invalid
    end
    API->>DNS: MX lookup, then A/AAAA, 2 s budget
    alt no MX and no A record
      API-->>F: 422 email-domain-undeliverable
    else records found, or timeout
      Note right of DNS: A timeout sets mx_status unknown and registration continues
    end
  end

  rect rgb(255, 242, 204)
    Note over API,V: Advisory only. A failure or timeout drops the warnings and never changes the status.
    par typo advice
      API->>AD: suggest_domain with the email domain only
      AD->>V: Structured Gemini call
      V-->>AD: is_likely_typo, suggested_domain, confidence
    and duplicate advice
      API->>BQ: find_fuzzy_candidates.sql blocking query, read-only
      API->>AD: assess_candidates with up to 5 candidates as refs c1 to c5
      AD->>V: Structured Gemini call
      V-->>AD: verdict, confidence, and reason codes per ref
    end
    AD-->>API: possible_typo and possible_duplicate warnings, or advisory_status unavailable
  end

  rect rgb(213, 232, 212)
    Note over API,BQ: The BigQuery transaction decides created, replay, mismatch, or duplicate.
    API->>S: register(command, channel, idempotency_key)
    loop on LockConflict, up to 3 retries with jitter within 10 s
      S->>BQ: BEGIN TRANSACTION
      S->>BQ: DELETE FROM customers WHERE FALSE, which takes the table lock
      S->>BQ: Idempotency replay check on registration_audit_logs
      S->>BQ: Parameterized MERGE, insert only when no email, phone, or tax-ID hash matches
      alt inserted
        S->>BQ: Audit INSERT, then COMMIT
      else matched
        S->>BQ: matched_on query, then ROLLBACK
      end
      BQ-->>S: Outcome row, or abort on concurrent update
    end
    S-->>API: created, replay, fingerprint_mismatch, duplicate, or RegistrationBusy
    opt outcome is not created
      API->>BQ: Standalone audit INSERT
    end
    alt created
      API-->>F: 201 RegistrationCreated with warnings and advisory_status
    else replay
      API-->>F: 201 with the original customer_id and Idempotent-Replayed true
    else fingerprint mismatch
      API-->>F: 422 idempotency-key-reused
    else duplicate
      API-->>F: 409 customer-duplicate with matched_on
    else lock retries exhausted
      API-->>F: 503 registration-busy with Retry-After 60
    end
  end

  F-->>U: Success card with warnings, or errors under the matching fields
